 s/2026/06/ABC-loves-teachers-1200x900-1.jpg
UID:wNEiAr3iLfh1ETp-QTyET
SUMMARY:ABC13 Loves Teachers
DTSTAMP:20260702T102618Z
DTSTART:20260731T060000Z
DESCRIPTION:ABC13 Loves Teachers!  This annual community drive held by ABC1
	3 and its community partners collects school supplies and monetary donatio
	ns to support Houston Food Bank’s School programs\, which provides essenti
	al resources for teachers and students in low-income schools.  Help ensure
	 that students have the supplies they need to succeed in school by donatin
	g things like pens\, pencils\, paper\, crayons\, notebooks and other schoo
	l essentials!  You can also check our Most Needed Items list below.\n\nABC
	13 Loves Teachers will be held on Friday\, July 31 from 6 am to 6 pm.  You
	 can deliver new school supplies at drop-off locations throughout the ABC1
	3 coverage area (see full list below)\, at Houston Food Bank (535 Portwall
	)\, or make a secure donation via the event page.\nDonateLOCATIONSHoustonH
	ouston Food Bank\n535 Portwall Street\nHouston\, TX 77029\nHours: 6 a.m. t
	o 6 p.m. \nGalvestonGalveston ISD Support Center\n3904 Avenue T\nGalveston
	\, TX 77550\nHours: 8 a.m. to 12 p.m. \nRichmond/RosenbergVFW Hall – Post\
	n3903 1903 1st Street\nRosenberg\, TX 77471\nHours: 8 a.m. to 2 p.m. \nHou
	ston/Montrose AreaThe Ismaili Center\n2323 Allen Parkway\nHouston\, TX 770
	19\nHours: 9 a.m. to 1 p.m. \nSugar LandIsmaili Jamatkhana\n1700 First Col
	ony Boulevard\nSugar Land\, TX 77479\nHours: 9 a.m. to 1 p.m. \nMOST NEEDE
	D SUPPLIES\nCrayons\nHighlighters\nMarkers\nPencils\nFolders\nPens\nCompos
	ition Books\nSpiral Notebooks\nPost-It Notes\nFiller Paper\nPencil Cases\n
	Lysol Wipes\nScissors\nGlue Bottles\nHand Sanitizer\nGlue Sticks\nKleenex\
	nPaper Towels\nHand Sanitizer\nAntibacterial Wipes\n\nBENEFITTING SCHOOLS 
	AND DISTRICTSAAMA Sanchez Charter School\nAldine ISD\nAlief ISD\nAlvin ISD
	\nAngleton ISD\nBrazosport ISD\nChannelview ISD\nCleveland ISD\nCypress Fa
	irbanks ISD\nDayton ISD\nDickinson ISD\nEast Chambers ISD\nFort Bend ISD\n
	Galena Park ISD\nGalveston ISD\nGoose Creek ISD\nHarris County Department 
	of Education\nHitchcock ISD\nHouston ISD\nHouston Gateway Academy Charter 
	School\nHumble ISD\nInternational Leadership of Texas\nKIPP Houston Public
	 Schools\nKaty ISD\nKlein ISD\nLamar Consolidated ISD\nPasadena ISD\nPearl
	and ISD\nResponsive Education\nRoyal ISD\nSan Francisco Nativity Academy\n
	SER- Ninos\nSealy ISD\nSheldon ISD\nSmall Steps Charter School\nSouthwest 
	Schools\nSpring Branch ISD\nSpring ISD\nTexas City ISD\nThe Rhodes School\
	nTrinity ISD\nVarnett ISD\nYes Prep\nYellowstone Academy\n\nhttps://www.ho
	ustonfoodbank.org/upcomingevent/abc13-loves-teachers/\n\nFrom Houston Food
	 Bank
URL:https://www.houstonfoodbank.org/upcomingevent/abc13-loves-teachers/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:houston-food-bank
CATEGORIES:Houston Food Bank
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT12H
END:VEVENT
